{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116777","id":3327944589,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7GXGeN","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116777","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116777.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116777.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116777","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116777/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116777/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116777/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/032d2935a60dc9198cc2d42dd771f1fe3f8c636f","number":116777,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix misleading physics picking doc in `Viewport`","user":{"login":"Jordyfel","id":76705401,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzA1NDAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76705401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordyfel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"While investigating the physics picking features for a 3D game, I came across this note in `Viewport`:\r\n> The number of simultaneously pickable objects is limited to 64 and they are selected in a non-deterministic order, which can be different in each picking process.\r\n\r\nI took this to mean that having more than 64 pickable `CollisionObject3D`s in a scene will not work. Being very confused by why such a limitation is necessary I started browsing the source and PR history. The note was added in #80875 with this context - https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/80769#issuecomment-1684466790.\r\n\r\nTurns out the limit of 64 is for `CanvasItem` picking, which I didn't know existed at all, and it also is about number of objects pickable by a single event, so the note is doubly misleading.\r\n\r\nAlso reworded some other parts of the physics picking docs.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","